@lang en
IMPORT `aptduv-ch2-benefits`

-- Tests for the AIA An Phuc Tron Doi Uu Viet rules and terms (V082021).
--
-- Every expected value comes from the SOURCE: a figure or rate the document prints, or
-- arithmetic on it worked by hand and written beside the assertion. Calendar dates were worked
-- out with Python's datetime, which shares nothing with L4. The rows of the five tables
-- (7.2.3, 7.7, 14.5.3, Article 17, Article 32) are generated from the raw text by
-- scratchpad/vn25/gentables.py, which parses each printed row and converts the Vietnamese
-- decimal comma ("98,5%") into an L4 literal; they are not retyped. None was copied from an
-- evaluation. A failing assertion is a finding, never a value to edit.
--
-- Money is dong. Hypothetical figures (a sum insured of 500,000,000, an account value of
-- 50,000,000, a cost of insurance of 150,000 a month) are scenario inputs, chosen to make the
-- arithmetic visible; they are not in the document.

§ `Tests`

§§ `Fixtures`

GIVEN eff IS A DATE
      dob IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The contract`
`a contract effective` eff `for an insured born` dob MEANS
    `The contract` WITH
        `effective date`                                              IS eff
        `date the Company accepted the insurance`                     IS eff PLUS 10
        `date of the last reinstatement`                              IS NOTHING
        `date of the last increase of the current sum insured`        IS NOTHING
        `insured's date of birth`                                     IS dob
        `premium mode`                                                IS monthly
        `annualised basic premium of the first contract year`         IS 12_000_000
        `accepted on standard terms at issue or at the last reinstatement` IS TRUE

-- C1: effective 31 January 2021, accepted 10 February 2021, insured born 15 June 1980. The
-- insured is 40 on the effective date, and his insurance age is 40 + (k - 1) in contract year k.
`C1` MEANS `a contract effective` (YMD 2021 1 31) `for an insured born` (YMD 1980 6 15)

-- C1 reinstated on 1 June 2024.
`C1 reinstated` MEANS
    `The contract` WITH
        `effective date`                                              IS YMD 2021 1 31
        `date the Company accepted the insurance`                     IS YMD 2021 2 10
        `date of the last reinstatement`                              IS JUST (YMD 2024 6 1)
        `date of the last increase of the current sum insured`        IS NOTHING
        `insured's date of birth`                                     IS YMD 1980 6 15
        `premium mode`                                                IS monthly
        `annualised basic premium of the first contract year`         IS 12_000_000
        `accepted on standard terms at issue or at the last reinstatement` IS TRUE

-- C2: a child, born 1 March 2021, effective 15 April 2021: insurance age 0 in contract year 1,
-- 1 in year 2, 2 in year 3.
`C2` MEANS `a contract effective` (YMD 2021 4 15) `for an insured born` (YMD 2021 3 1)

-- C3: an insured born on the day and month of the effective date, so that the 100th birthday
-- falls on an anniversary.
`C3` MEANS `a contract effective` (YMD 2021 6 15) `for an insured born` (YMD 1980 6 15)

GIVEN opt IS A `A benefit option`
      sa  IS A NUMBER
      b   IS A NUMBER
      a   IS A NUMBER
      debts IS A NUMBER
      k   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The state of the contract`
`in force with` opt `, sum insured` sa `, basic value` b `, accumulation value` a `, debts` debts `, cancer paid` k MEANS
    `The state of the contract` WITH
        `in force`                    IS TRUE
        `benefit option`              IS opt
        `current sum insured`         IS sa
        `basic account value`         IS b
        `accumulation account value`  IS a
        `outstanding debts`           IS debts
        `cancer benefit already paid` IS k

-- The basic benefit, sum insured 500,000,000, account value 50,000,000 (40,000,000 basic,
-- 10,000,000 accumulation), no debts, no cancer benefit paid.
`S basic` MEANS `in force with` `the basic benefit` `, sum insured` 500_000_000 `, basic value` 40_000_000 `, accumulation value` 10_000_000 `, debts` 0 `, cancer paid` 0
`S enhanced` MEANS `in force with` `the enhanced benefit` `, sum insured` 500_000_000 `, basic value` 40_000_000 `, accumulation value` 10_000_000 `, debts` 0 `, cancer paid` 0
`S basic, rich` MEANS `in force with` `the basic benefit` `, sum insured` 500_000_000 `, basic value` 500_000_000 `, accumulation value` 100_000_000 `, debts` 0 `, cancer paid` 0
`S lapsed` MEANS
    `The state of the contract` WITH
        `in force`                    IS FALSE
        `benefit option`              IS `the basic benefit`
        `current sum insured`         IS 500_000_000
        `basic account value`         IS 40_000_000
        `accumulation account value`  IS 10_000_000
        `outstanding debts`           IS 0
        `cancer benefit already paid` IS 0

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The cause of a death or disability`
`an ordinary cause first existing on` d MEANS
    `The cause of a death or disability` WITH
        `an act of insurance fraud`    IS FALSE
        `suicide or attempted suicide` IS FALSE
        `date the cause first existed` IS d
        `war`                          IS FALSE

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The cause of a death or disability`
`a suicide on` d MEANS
    `The cause of a death or disability` WITH
        `an act of insurance fraud`    IS FALSE
        `suicide or attempted suicide` IS TRUE
        `date the cause first existed` IS d
        `war`                          IS FALSE

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The cause of a death or disability`
`an act of war on` d MEANS
    `The cause of a death or disability` WITH
        `an act of insurance fraud`    IS FALSE
        `suicide or attempted suicide` IS FALSE
        `date the cause first existed` IS d
        `war`                          IS TRUE

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The cause of a death or disability`
`an act of insurance fraud on` d MEANS
    `The cause of a death or disability` WITH
        `an act of insurance fraud`    IS TRUE
        `suicide or attempted suicide` IS FALSE
        `date the cause first existed` IS d
        `war`                          IS FALSE

GIVEN d  IS A DATE
      cs IS A LIST OF `A circumstance listed in 8.2`
GIVETH AN `An accident`
`an accident on` d `in the circumstances` cs MEANS
    `An accident` WITH
        `date of the accident`                                        IS d
        `by the impact of a sudden, external force or object`         IS TRUE
        `unintended and against the will of the insured`              IS TRUE
        `the direct and sole cause, unrelated to any other cause`     IS TRUE
        `excluded circumstances`                                      IS cs

`Lan` MEANS
    `A beneficiary` WITH
        `name`                             IS "Lan"
        `designated share`                 IS 60%
        `died before the insured`          IS FALSE
        `took part in the intentional act` IS FALSE

`Minh` MEANS
    `A beneficiary` WITH
        `name`                             IS "Minh"
        `designated share`                 IS 40%
        `died before the insured`          IS FALSE
        `took part in the intentional act` IS TRUE

`Lan and Minh` MEANS LIST `Lan`, `Minh`

GIVEN d   IS A DATE
      c   IS A `The cause of a death or disability`
      acc IS A MAYBE `An accident`
      ns  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A death`
`a death on` d `, cause` c `, accident` acc `, non-smoker` ns MEANS
    `A death` WITH
        `date of death`                     IS d
        `the cause`                         IS c
        `the accident`                      IS acc
        `determined to be a non-smoker`     IS ns
        `premiums received after the death` IS 0
        `the beneficiaries`                 IS `Lan and Minh`
        `the policyholder has died`         IS FALSE

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `The aggregate limit at the time of payment`
`no limit raised, already received` x MEANS
    `The aggregate limit at the time of payment` WITH
        `limit published at the time of payment`                              IS NOTHING
        `the same kind of benefit already received under all contracts with the Company` IS x

§§ `Tables, generated from the raw text`

-- 7.2.3, one assertion per row, read from src:940-956. A row 'under N' is tested at age N-1,
-- the only age at which it is the first row that matches; the last row at its own age.
-- src:940 | Dưới 1 tuổi 20% Số tiền bảo hiểm hiện tại
#ASSERT `7.2.3 — the part of the current sum insured used, at insurance age` 0 EQUALS 20%
-- src:947 | Dưới 2 tuổi 40% Số tiền bảo hiểm hiện tại
#ASSERT `7.2.3 — the part of the current sum insured used, at insurance age` 1 EQUALS 40%
-- src:948 | Dưới 3 tuổi 60% Số tiền bảo hiểm hiện tại
#ASSERT `7.2.3 — the part of the current sum insured used, at insurance age` 2 EQUALS 60%
-- src:949 | Dưới 4 tuổi 80% Số tiền bảo hiểm hiện tại
#ASSERT `7.2.3 — the part of the current sum insured used, at insurance age` 3 EQUALS 80%
-- src:956 | Từ 4 tuổi trở lên 100% Số tiền bảo hiểm hiện tại
#ASSERT `7.2.3 — the part of the current sum insured used, at insurance age` 4 EQUALS 100%

-- 7.7, the loyalty bonus by anniversary, read from src:1070-1072.
-- src:1070 | 10 100% Tổng Số tiền tính Thưởng
#ASSERT `7.7 — the part of the total bonus base paid on anniversary` 10 EQUALS 100%
-- src:1071 | 15 10% Tổng Số tiền tính Thưởng
#ASSERT `7.7 — the part of the total bonus base paid on anniversary` 15 EQUALS 10%
-- src:1072 | 20 10% Tổng Số tiền tính Thưởng
#ASSERT `7.7 — the part of the total bonus base paid on anniversary` 20 EQUALS 10%

-- 7.7, the five windows, read from src:1098-1113. The first year is the NUMERAL printed (fork F26);
-- The generator also checks that each window ends with the anniversary's own contract year.
-- src:1099 | 6
-- src:1100 | hợp đồng thứ 2 (hai) đến Năm hợp đồng thứ 6 (sáu)
#ASSERT `7.7 — the first contract year whose interest is recorded on anniversary` 6 EQUALS 2
-- src:1103 | 7
-- src:1104 | hợp đồng thứ 3 (ba) đến Năm hợp đồng thứ 7 (bảy)
#ASSERT `7.7 — the first contract year whose interest is recorded on anniversary` 7 EQUALS 3
-- src:1106 | 8
-- src:1107 | hợp đồng thứ 4 (tư) đến Năm hợp đồng thứ 8 (tám)
#ASSERT `7.7 — the first contract year whose interest is recorded on anniversary` 8 EQUALS 4
-- src:1109 | 9
-- src:1110 | hợp đồng thứ 5 (năm) đến Năm hợp đồng thứ 9 (chín)
#ASSERT `7.7 — the first contract year whose interest is recorded on anniversary` 9 EQUALS 5
-- src:1112 | 10
-- src:1113 | hợp đồng thứ 6 (năm) đến Năm hợp đồng thứ 10 (mười)
#ASSERT `7.7 — the first contract year whose interest is recorded on anniversary` 10 EQUALS 6

