§§ `Number format`

-- "100.000.000 đồng" (5.1), "10 (mười) tỷ đồng" (7.4, 7.5), "30.000" and "60.000" (Article 19):
-- the dot groups thousands, so these are a hundred million, ten billion, thirty thousand and
-- sixty thousand dong.
#ASSERT `5.1 — the temporary insurance amount` EQUALS 100000000
#ASSERT `7.4 and 7.5 — the limit in force at payment, under` (`no limit raised, already received` 0) EQUALS 10000000000
#ASSERT `19 — the contract administration charge as printed` EQUALS 30000
#ASSERT `19 — the cap on the contract administration charge as printed` EQUALS 60000
-- "2%/năm" (Article 20).
#ASSERT `20 — the maximum fund management charge as printed` EQUALS 0.02

§§ `Article 1 — dates and ages`

-- Age by the last birthday: born 15 June 1980, 40 on 14 June 2021 and 41 on 15 June 2021.
#ASSERT `the age in completed years of someone born` (YMD 1980 6 15) `on` (YMD 2021 6 14) EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `the age in completed years of someone born` (YMD 1980 6 15) `on` (YMD 2021 6 15) EQUALS 41

-- 1.8: a contract made on the 31st has its monthiversary on the last day of a shorter month.
#ASSERT `1.8 — monthiversary number` 1 `of` `C1` EQUALS YMD 2021 2 28
#ASSERT `1.8 — monthiversary number` 2 `of` `C1` EQUALS YMD 2021 3 31
#ASSERT `1.8 — monthiversary number` 3 `of` `C1` EQUALS YMD 2021 4 30

-- 1.7 and 1.11: contract year 1 ends the day before the first anniversary.
#ASSERT `1.7 — contract anniversary number` 1 `of` `C1` EQUALS YMD 2022 1 31
#ASSERT `1.11 — the contract year in which` (YMD 2021 1 31) `falls, under` `C1` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `1.11 — the contract year in which` (YMD 2022 1 30) `falls, under` `C1` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `1.11 — the contract year in which` (YMD 2022 1 31) `falls, under` `C1` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT REFUSED `1.11 — the contract year in which` (YMD 2021 1 30) `falls, under` `C1`

-- 1.32: the insurance age moves only on an anniversary. The insured turns 41 on 15 June 2021,
-- but his insurance age stays 40 until 31 January 2022.
#ASSERT `1.32 — the insurance age on` (YMD 2021 7 1) `under` `C1` EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `1.32 — the insurance age on` (YMD 2022 1 30) `under` `C1` EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `1.32 — the insurance age on` (YMD 2022 1 31) `under` `C1` EQUALS 41

-- 1.9 and Article 4: 100th birthday 15 June 2080; the first anniversary after it, 31 January
-- 2081. Where the birthday falls on an anniversary (C3), the anniversary STRICTLY after it.
#ASSERT `1.9 — the maturity date of` `C1` EQUALS YMD 2081 1 31
#ASSERT `1.9 — the maturity date of` `C3` EQUALS YMD 2081 6 15

-- 1.6: the later of completion and full payment of the first basic premium.
GIVEN completed IS A DATE
      paid      IS A MAYBE DATE
      accepted  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An application`
`an application completed on` completed `, paid` paid `, accepted` accepted MEANS
    `An application` WITH
        `the policyholder`                                IS `A policyholder` WITH
                                                              `an organisation`                     IS FALSE
                                                              `date of birth`                       IS JUST (YMD 1980 6 15)
                                                              `full civil act capacity`             IS TRUE
                                                              `declared and signed the application` IS TRUE
        `the insured`                                     IS `An insured person` WITH
                                                              `date of birth`                       IS YMD 1980 6 15
                                                              `living in Vietnam when the application was submitted` IS TRUE
        `relationship of the insured to the policyholder` IS `the policyholder themself`
        `date the application was completed`              IS completed
        `date the first basic premium was paid in full`   IS paid
        `accepted by the Company`                         IS accepted
        `signed in person by the insured`                 IS TRUE
        `signed by a parent or guardian of the insured, on the application or another consent` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `1.6 — the effective date for` (`an application completed on` (YMD 2021 3 1) `, paid` (JUST (YMD 2021 3 5)) `, accepted` TRUE) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2021 3 5)
#ASSERT `1.6 — the effective date for` (`an application completed on` (YMD 2021 3 5) `, paid` (JUST (YMD 2021 3 1)) `, accepted` TRUE) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2021 3 5)
#ASSERT `1.6 — the effective date for` (`an application completed on` (YMD 2021 3 1) `, paid` (JUST (YMD 2021 3 5)) `, accepted` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `1.6 — the effective date for` (`an application completed on` (YMD 2021 3 1) `, paid` NOTHING `, accepted` TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Article 2 — the parties to the application qualify` (`an application completed on` (YMD 2021 3 1) `, paid` (JUST (YMD 2021 3 5)) `, accepted` TRUE)

-- 1.2: 18 or more (both sides), full capacity, an organisation.
GIVEN dob IS A DATE
      cap IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A policyholder`
`an individual policyholder born` dob `, capacity` cap MEANS
    `A policyholder` WITH
        `an organisation`                     IS FALSE
        `date of birth`                       IS JUST dob
        `full civil act capacity`             IS cap
        `declared and signed the application` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `1.2 — the policyholder` (`an individual policyholder born` (YMD 2003 3 1) `, capacity` TRUE) `qualifies on` (YMD 2021 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `1.2 — the policyholder` (`an individual policyholder born` (YMD 2003 3 2) `, capacity` TRUE) `qualifies on` (YMD 2021 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `1.2 — the policyholder` (`an individual policyholder born` (YMD 1980 3 1) `, capacity` FALSE) `qualifies on` (YMD 2021 3 1)
#ASSERT `1.2 — the policyholder` (`A policyholder` WITH `an organisation` IS TRUE, `date of birth` IS NOTHING, `full civil act capacity` IS TRUE, `declared and signed the application` IS TRUE) `qualifies on` (YMD 2021 3 1)

-- 1.3: 30 days old (31 March 2021 for a birth on 1 March 2021) and not 29; 65 and not 66;
-- living in Vietnam.
GIVEN dob IS A DATE
      vn  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An insured person`
`an insured born` dob `, in Vietnam` vn MEANS
    `An insured person` WITH
        `date of birth`                                       IS dob
        `living in Vietnam when the application was submitted` IS vn

#ASSERT `1.3 — the insured` (`an insured born` (YMD 2021 3 1) `, in Vietnam` TRUE) `qualifies on the effective date` (YMD 2021 3 31) `, accepted` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `1.3 — the insured` (`an insured born` (YMD 2021 3 1) `, in Vietnam` TRUE) `qualifies on the effective date` (YMD 2021 3 30) `, accepted` TRUE
#ASSERT `1.3 — the insured` (`an insured born` (YMD 1955 6 15) `, in Vietnam` TRUE) `qualifies on the effective date` (YMD 2021 6 14) `, accepted` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `1.3 — the insured` (`an insured born` (YMD 1955 6 15) `, in Vietnam` TRUE) `qualifies on the effective date` (YMD 2021 6 15) `, accepted` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `1.3 — the insured` (`an insured born` (YMD 1980 6 15) `, in Vietnam` FALSE) `qualifies on the effective date` (YMD 2021 6 15) `, accepted` TRUE

-- 1.16: five times the annualised first-year basic premium of 12,000,000.
#ASSERT `1.16 — the most accumulation premium the contract may take in one contract year` `C1` EQUALS 60000000
-- 1.17 and 1.21 and 1.25.
#ASSERT `1.17 — the planned premium of` 1000000 `and` 500000 EQUALS 1500000
#ASSERT `1.21 — the monthly deduction of` 150000 `and` 30000 EQUALS 180000
#ASSERT `1.25 — the account value of` `S basic` EQUALS 50000000

§§ `1.29 — total and permanent disability`

GIVEN hands IS A NUMBER
      legs  IS A NUMBER
      eyes  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A disability`
`a disability of hands` hands `, legs` legs `, eyes` eyes MEANS
    `A disability` WITH
        `date of the disability`                         IS YMD 2030 3 1
        `hands lost or irrecoverably paralysed`          IS hands
        `legs lost or irrecoverably paralysed`           IS legs
        `eyes totally and permanently blind`             IS eyes
        `certified rate of disability or of permanent loss of working capacity` IS NOTHING
        `certified by`                                   IS `another body`
        `date of the certification`                      IS NOTHING
        `the cause`                                      IS `an ordinary cause first existing on` (YMD 2030 3 1)

-- (a), each bullet, and two near misses.
#ASSERT `1.29(a) — loss or irrecoverable paralysis` (`a disability of hands` 2 `, legs` 0 `, eyes` 0)
#ASSERT `1.29(a) — loss or irrecoverable paralysis` (`a disability of hands` 0 `, legs` 2 `, eyes` 0)
#ASSERT `1.29(a) — loss or irrecoverable paralysis` (`a disability of hands` 1 `, legs` 1 `, eyes` 0)
#ASSERT `1.29(a) — loss or irrecoverable paralysis` (`a disability of hands` 0 `, legs` 0 `, eyes` 2)
#ASSERT `1.29(a) — loss or irrecoverable paralysis` (`a disability of hands` 1 `, legs` 0 `, eyes` 1)
#ASSERT `1.29(a) — loss or irrecoverable paralysis` (`a disability of hands` 0 `, legs` 1 `, eyes` 1)
#ASSERT NOT `1.29(a) — loss or irrecoverable paralysis` (`a disability of hands` 1 `, legs` 0 `, eyes` 0)
#ASSERT NOT `1.29(a) — loss or irrecoverable paralysis` (`a disability of hands` 0 `, legs` 0 `, eyes` 1)

GIVEN rate     IS A NUMBER
      certifier IS A `A certifying body`
      certday   IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A disability`
`a disability certified at` rate `, by` certifier `, on` certday MEANS
    `A disability` WITH
        `date of the disability`                         IS YMD 2030 3 1
        `hands lost or irrecoverably paralysed`          IS 0
        `legs lost or irrecoverably paralysed`           IS 0
        `eyes totally and permanently blind`             IS 0
        `certified rate of disability or of permanent loss of working capacity` IS JUST rate
        `certified by`                                   IS certifier
        `date of the certification`                      IS JUST certday
        `the cause`                                      IS `an ordinary cause first existing on` (YMD 2030 3 1)

-- (b): 81% and not 80%; certified exactly six months after the disability (1 September 2030)
-- and not the day before; by the two bodies (b) names and not by the foreign body of 27.1.
#ASSERT `1.29(b) — certified at 81% or more` (`a disability certified at` (81%) `, by` `a provincial or centrally-run city medical assessment council` `, on` (YMD 2030 9 1))
#ASSERT `1.29(b) — certified at 81% or more` (`a disability certified at` (81%) `, by` `an independent medical organisation approved by the Company` `, on` (YMD 2030 9 1))
#ASSERT NOT `1.29(b) — certified at 81% or more` (`a disability certified at` (80%) `, by` `a provincial or centrally-run city medical assessment council` `, on` (YMD 2030 9 1))
#ASSERT NOT `1.29(b) — certified at 81% or more` (`a disability certified at` (81%) `, by` `a provincial or centrally-run city medical assessment council` `, on` (YMD 2030 8 31))
#ASSERT NOT `1.29(b) — certified at 81% or more` (`a disability certified at` (90%) `, by` `a lawful foreign medical organisation approved by the Company` `, on` (YMD 2030 9 1))

§§ `1.30 — cancer, and its exclusions`

GIVEN arose IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A cancer`
`an invasive cancer arising on` arose MEANS
    `A cancer` WITH
        `a malignant tumour confirmed by histology, growing uncontrollably and invading tissue` IS TRUE
        `date the cancer arose`                                        IS arose
        `pre-malignant, non-invasive or in situ, or of borderline or low malignancy` IS FALSE
        `a tumour of the prostate, thyroid or bladder classified T1N0M0` IS FALSE
        `chronic lymphocytic leukaemia`                                IS FALSE
        `RAI stage`                                                    IS NOTHING
        `in the presence of HIV infection`                            IS FALSE
        `a skin cancer`                                                IS FALSE
        `malignant melanoma`                                           IS FALSE
        `Breslow depth in millimetres`                                 IS NOTHING
        `Clark level`                                                  IS NOTHING

GIVEN insitu IS A BOOLEAN
      t1     IS A BOOLEAN
      cll    IS A BOOLEAN
      rai    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      hiv    IS A BOOLEAN
      skin   IS A BOOLEAN
      mel    IS A BOOLEAN
      depth  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      clark  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `A cancer`
`a cancer, in situ` insitu `, T1N0M0` t1 `, CLL` cll `, RAI` rai `, HIV` hiv `, skin` skin `, melanoma` mel `, Breslow` depth `, Clark` clark MEANS
    `A cancer` WITH
        `a malignant tumour confirmed by histology, growing uncontrollably and invading tissue` IS TRUE
        `date the cancer arose`                                        IS YMD 2030 3 1
        `pre-malignant, non-invasive or in situ, or of borderline or low malignancy` IS insitu
        `a tumour of the prostate, thyroid or bladder classified T1N0M0` IS t1
        `chronic lymphocytic leukaemia`                                IS cll
        `RAI stage`                                                    IS rai
        `in the presence of HIV infection`                            IS hiv
        `a skin cancer`                                                IS skin
        `malignant melanoma`                                           IS mel
        `Breslow depth in millimetres`                                 IS depth
        `Clark level`                                                  IS clark

#ASSERT `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`an invasive cancer arising on` (YMD 2030 3 1))
-- (a) carcinoma in situ.
#ASSERT NOT `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`a cancer, in situ` TRUE `, T1N0M0` FALSE `, CLL` FALSE `, RAI` NOTHING `, HIV` FALSE `, skin` FALSE `, melanoma` FALSE `, Breslow` NOTHING `, Clark` NOTHING)
-- (b) T1N0M0 prostate, thyroid or bladder.
#ASSERT NOT `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`a cancer, in situ` FALSE `, T1N0M0` TRUE `, CLL` FALSE `, RAI` NOTHING `, HIV` FALSE `, skin` FALSE `, melanoma` FALSE `, Breslow` NOTHING `, Clark` NOTHING)
-- (c) CLL below RAI stage 3, and the near miss at stage 3.
#ASSERT NOT `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`a cancer, in situ` FALSE `, T1N0M0` FALSE `, CLL` TRUE `, RAI` (JUST 2) `, HIV` FALSE `, skin` FALSE `, melanoma` FALSE `, Breslow` NOTHING `, Clark` NOTHING)
#ASSERT `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`a cancer, in situ` FALSE `, T1N0M0` FALSE `, CLL` TRUE `, RAI` (JUST 3) `, HIV` FALSE `, skin` FALSE `, melanoma` FALSE `, Breslow` NOTHING `, Clark` NOTHING)
#ASSERT REFUSED `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`a cancer, in situ` FALSE `, T1N0M0` FALSE `, CLL` TRUE `, RAI` NOTHING `, HIV` FALSE `, skin` FALSE `, melanoma` FALSE `, Breslow` NOTHING `, Clark` NOTHING)
-- (d) HIV.
#ASSERT NOT `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`a cancer, in situ` FALSE `, T1N0M0` FALSE `, CLL` FALSE `, RAI` NOTHING `, HIV` TRUE `, skin` FALSE `, melanoma` FALSE `, Breslow` NOTHING `, Clark` NOTHING)
-- (e) a skin cancer that is not a melanoma; a melanoma under 1.5 mm; at 1.5 mm and Clark 3
-- (the near miss); under Clark 3; and a melanoma with neither measure, declined.
#ASSERT NOT `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`a cancer, in situ` FALSE `, T1N0M0` FALSE `, CLL` FALSE `, RAI` NOTHING `, HIV` FALSE `, skin` TRUE `, melanoma` FALSE `, Breslow` NOTHING `, Clark` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`a cancer, in situ` FALSE `, T1N0M0` FALSE `, CLL` FALSE `, RAI` NOTHING `, HIV` FALSE `, skin` TRUE `, melanoma` TRUE `, Breslow` (JUST 1.4) `, Clark` (JUST 3))
#ASSERT `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`a cancer, in situ` FALSE `, T1N0M0` FALSE `, CLL` FALSE `, RAI` NOTHING `, HIV` FALSE `, skin` TRUE `, melanoma` TRUE `, Breslow` (JUST 1.5) `, Clark` (JUST 3))
#ASSERT NOT `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`a cancer, in situ` FALSE `, T1N0M0` FALSE `, CLL` FALSE `, RAI` NOTHING `, HIV` FALSE `, skin` TRUE `, melanoma` TRUE `, Breslow` (JUST 2) `, Clark` (JUST 2))
#ASSERT REFUSED `1.30 — the illness is a Cancer` (`a cancer, in situ` FALSE `, T1N0M0` FALSE `, CLL` FALSE `, RAI` NOTHING `, HIV` FALSE `, skin` TRUE `, melanoma` TRUE `, Breslow` NOTHING `, Clark` NOTHING)

-- (i) and (ii): C1 was accepted on 10 February 2021. Arising the day before: (i). On the day,
-- and on day 90 after it (11 May 2021): (ii). On day 91 (12 May 2021): neither.
#ASSERT `1.30(i) — the cancer arose before acceptance or reinstatement` (`an invasive cancer arising on` (YMD 2021 2 9)) `under` `C1`
#ASSERT `1.30(ii) — the cancer arose within 90 days after acceptance or reinstatement` (`an invasive cancer arising on` (YMD 2021 2 10)) `under` `C1`
#ASSERT `1.30(ii) — the cancer arose within 90 days after acceptance or reinstatement` (`an invasive cancer arising on` (YMD 2021 5 11)) `under` `C1`
#ASSERT NOT `1.30(ii) — the cancer arose within 90 days after acceptance or reinstatement` (`an invasive cancer arising on` (YMD 2021 5 12)) `under` `C1`
#ASSERT NOT `1.30(i) — the cancer arose before acceptance or reinstatement` (`an invasive cancer arising on` (YMD 2021 5 12)) `under` `C1`
-- A reinstatement on 1 June 2024 restarts the window: a cancer arising on 1 July 2024 is caught.
#ASSERT `1.30(ii) — the cancer arose within 90 days after acceptance or reinstatement` (`an invasive cancer arising on` (YMD 2024 7 1)) `under` `C1 reinstated`

