§§ `Article 5 — Temporary insurance`

GIVEN acc IS A MAYBE `An accident`
      sui IS A BOOLEAN
      sa  IS A NUMBER
      prem IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A death during temporary insurance`
`a death in temporary cover on 10 March 2021, accident` acc `, suicide` sui `, sums insured` sa `, first premiums` prem MEANS
    `A death during temporary insurance` WITH
        `date the application was completed and the first premium paid in full` IS YMD 2021 3 1
        `date the temporary cover ended`                                       IS NOTHING
        `date of death`                                                        IS YMD 2021 3 10
        `the accident`                                                         IS acc
        `suicide`                                                              IS sui
        `total sum insured of all applications for the same insured`           IS sa
        `total first premiums paid on all applications for the same insured`   IS prem
        `medical examination costs`                                            IS 2_000_000

`a road accident on 9 March 2021` MEANS JUST (`an accident on` (YMD 2021 3 9) `in the circumstances` EMPTY)

-- 5.1: the lesser of 100,000,000 and the sums insured: 100,000,000 on 500,000,000 insured;
-- 50,000,000 on 50,000,000 insured.
#ASSERT `5.1 — the temporary insurance benefit` (`a death in temporary cover on 10 March 2021, accident` `a road accident on 9 March 2021` `, suicide` FALSE `, sums insured` 500000000 `, first premiums` 20000000) EQUALS 100000000
#ASSERT `5.1 — the temporary insurance benefit` (`a death in temporary cover on 10 March 2021, accident` `a road accident on 9 March 2021` `, suicide` FALSE `, sums insured` 50000000 `, first premiums` 20000000) EQUALS 50000000
#ASSERT `Article 5 — the first premiums refunded` (`a death in temporary cover on 10 March 2021, accident` `a road accident on 9 March 2021` `, suicide` FALSE `, sums insured` 500000000 `, first premiums` 20000000) EQUALS 0
-- First premiums of 120,000,000 (above 100,000,000): no benefit, 120,000,000 less 2,000,000 back.
#ASSERT `5.1 — the temporary insurance benefit` (`a death in temporary cover on 10 March 2021, accident` `a road accident on 9 March 2021` `, suicide` FALSE `, sums insured` 500000000 `, first premiums` 120000000) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `Article 5 — the first premiums refunded` (`a death in temporary cover on 10 March 2021, accident` `a road accident on 9 March 2021` `, suicide` FALSE `, sums insured` 500000000 `, first premiums` 120000000) EQUALS 118000000
-- 5.4: suicide: no benefit; 20,000,000 less 2,000,000 back.
#ASSERT `5.1 — the temporary insurance benefit` (`a death in temporary cover on 10 March 2021, accident` NOTHING `, suicide` TRUE `, sums insured` 500000000 `, first premiums` 20000000) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `Article 5 — the first premiums refunded` (`a death in temporary cover on 10 March 2021, accident` NOTHING `, suicide` TRUE `, sums insured` 500000000 `, first premiums` 20000000) EQUALS 18000000
-- An illness: no benefit, and the refund is not addressed.
#ASSERT `5.1 — the temporary insurance benefit` (`a death in temporary cover on 10 March 2021, accident` NOTHING `, suicide` FALSE `, sums insured` 500000000 `, first premiums` 20000000) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 5 — the first premiums refunded` (`a death in temporary cover on 10 March 2021, accident` NOTHING `, suicide` FALSE `, sums insured` 500000000 `, first premiums` 20000000)

§§ `Article 6`

-- 6.2: no remedy for an innocent misstatement; one for "declined"; three for "limited".
