#ASSERT `6.2 — the remedies open to the Company for` (`A misstatement` WITH `intentional` IS TRUE, `with correct information the Company would have` IS `declined to insure the insured`) EQUALS LIST `refuse the benefit, end the contract and keep the premiums up to the end`
#ASSERT count (`6.2 — the remedies open to the Company for` (`A misstatement` WITH `intentional` IS TRUE, `with correct information the Company would have` IS `insured with limited benefits or an extra premium`)) EQUALS 3

