#ASSERT `7.6 — the rate credited, on a declared rate of` (6%) `in contract year` 1 EQUALS 6%
#ASSERT `7.6 — the rate credited, on a declared rate of` (3%) `in contract year` 9 EQUALS 3%
-- Article 32: a yield of 5% less the 2% charge is 3%, lifted to 5% in year 1; 3% in year 9.
#ASSERT `32 — the accumulation interest rate, from a yield of` (5%) `less a charge of` (2%) `, in contract year` 1 EQUALS 5%
#ASSERT `32 — the accumulation interest rate, from a yield of` (5%) `less a charge of` (2%) `, in contract year` 9 EQUALS 3%

-- 7.7: interest credited in contract year k of k x 100,000 (years 1 to 10). By the table:
--   on anniversary 6,  50% of (200,000 + ... + 600,000)   = 50% of 2,000,000 = 1,000,000
--   on anniversary 7,  50% of (300,000 + ... + 700,000)   = 50% of 2,500,000 = 1,250,000
--   on anniversary 8,  50% of 3,000,000 = 1,500,000; on 9, 50% of 3,500,000 = 1,750,000;
--   on anniversary 10, 50% of (600,000 + ... + 1,000,000) = 50% of 4,000,000 = 2,000,000
--   total 7,500,000: the bonus is 7,500,000 on the 10th anniversary and 750,000 on the 15th
--   and the 20th.
GIVEN ok IS A BOOLEAN
      two IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The record for the loyalty bonus`
`interest of k times 100,000 in year k, premiums paid` ok `, last two monthly paid` two MEANS
    `The record for the loyalty bonus` WITH
        `interest credited to the basic account value, by contract year` IS LIST 100000, 200000, 300000, 400000, 500000, 600000, 700000, 800000, 900000, 1000000
        `basic premiums of earlier contract years paid in full at each due date, grace period included` IS ok
        `the two most recent monthly basic premiums paid in full before the bonus date` IS two

`R` MEANS `interest of k times 100,000 in year k, premiums paid` TRUE `, last two monthly paid` TRUE
#ASSERT `7.7 — the bonus base recorded under` `R` `on anniversary` 6 EQUALS 1000000
#ASSERT `7.7 — the bonus base recorded under` `R` `on anniversary` 7 EQUALS 1250000
#ASSERT `7.7 — the bonus base recorded under` `R` `on anniversary` 8 EQUALS 1500000
#ASSERT `7.7 — the bonus base recorded under` `R` `on anniversary` 9 EQUALS 1750000
#ASSERT `7.7 — the bonus base recorded under` `R` `on anniversary` 10 EQUALS 2000000
#ASSERT `7.7 — the total bonus base under` `R` EQUALS 7500000
#ASSERT `7.7 — the loyalty bonus under` `C1` `and` `R` `on anniversary` 10 EQUALS 7500000
#ASSERT `7.7 — the loyalty bonus under` `C1` `and` `R` `on anniversary` 15 EQUALS 750000
#ASSERT `7.7 — the loyalty bonus under` `C1` `and` `R` `on anniversary` 20 EQUALS 750000
#ASSERT `7.7 — the loyalty bonus under` `C1` `and` `R` `on anniversary` 11 EQUALS 0
-- A monthly payer whose last two monthly premiums were late: no bonus. A missed premium in an
-- earlier year: no bonus.
#ASSERT `7.7 — the loyalty bonus under` `C1` `and` (`interest of k times 100,000 in year k, premiums paid` TRUE `, last two monthly paid` FALSE) `on anniversary` 10 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `7.7 — the loyalty bonus under` `C1` `and` (`interest of k times 100,000 in year k, premiums paid` FALSE `, last two monthly paid` TRUE) `on anniversary` 10 EQUALS 0

§§ `Article 8 — exclusions`

-- 8.1: fraud; war; suicide on 31 January 2023 (the last day of the 24 months from 31 January
-- 2021) and not on 1 February 2023; a reinstatement on 1 June 2024 reopens the window; a cause
-- that existed before the effective date.
#ASSERT `8.1 — excluded under` `C1` `, the cause being` (`an act of insurance fraud on` (YMD 2030 1 1)) `and the event on` (YMD 2030 1 1)
#ASSERT `8.1 — excluded under` `C1` `, the cause being` (`an act of war on` (YMD 2030 1 1)) `and the event on` (YMD 2030 1 1)
#ASSERT `8.1 — excluded under` `C1` `, the cause being` (`a suicide on` (YMD 2023 1 31)) `and the event on` (YMD 2023 1 31)
#ASSERT NOT `8.1 — excluded under` `C1` `, the cause being` (`a suicide on` (YMD 2023 2 1)) `and the event on` (YMD 2023 2 1)
#ASSERT `8.1 — excluded under` `C1 reinstated` `, the cause being` (`a suicide on` (YMD 2025 2 1)) `and the event on` (YMD 2025 2 1)
#ASSERT `8.1 — excluded under` `C1` `, the cause being` (`an ordinary cause first existing on` (YMD 2021 1 30)) `and the event on` (YMD 2030 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `8.1 — excluded under` `C1` `, the cause being` (`an ordinary cause first existing on` (YMD 2021 1 31)) `and the event on` (YMD 2030 1 1)

