§§ `Articles 7 and 8 together — the layers interact`

-- An accidental death on 10 March 2021, insurance age 40, a non-smoker, the basic benefit, a
-- sum insured of 500,000,000, an account value of 50,000,000, a cancer benefit of
-- 125,000,000 already paid, debts of 5,000,000:
--   7.2: the greater of 500,000,000 and 50,000,000          500,000,000
--   7.3: 10% of 500,000,000                                  +50,000,000
--   7.5: the cancer benefit comes off 7.2 and 7.3           -125,000,000
--   7.4: 100% of 500,000,000, within the limit              +500,000,000
--   total                                                    925,000,000
--   6.4: less the debts                                       -5,000,000  = 920,000,000
`S after cancer, with debts` MEANS `in force with` `the basic benefit` `, sum insured` 500000000 `, basic value` 40000000 `, accumulation value` 10000000 `, debts` 5000000 `, cancer paid` 125000000
