#ASSERT `6.4 — the amount paid on a benefit of` (`the benefit on the death under` `C1` `, at` `S after cancer, with debts` `, on` `an accidental death in 2021` `, limit` (`no limit raised, already received` 0)) `after debts of` 5000000 EQUALS 920000000
