#ASSERT `14.5 — the application of the payment under` `C1` `:` (`a payment in year` 5 `of` 11000000 `, still to fall due` 0 `, accumulation so far` 0) EQUALS `The application of a payment` WITH `applied to the basic premium` IS 11000000, `applied or held for the rider premiums` IS 0, `counted as accumulation premium` IS 0, `grace period opened` IS `the 60-day grace period for the supplementary products`
